# SDKMAN! environment for ktoggle.
# Pins the Java version used to build/test this service so it matches CI
# (GitHub Actions uses Temurin 21). Run `sdk env` (or `sdk env install`)
# in the project root to switch automatically. Enable auto-switching with:
#   sdk config  ->  set sdkman_auto_env=true
java=21.0.8-tem
